This directory is a create-only materialization boundary, not an artifact cache.

Before an owner-open Android build, an external qualified pipeline must place
exactly these two non-writable single-link files here:

  owner-open-rootfs.squashfs
  owner-open-rootfs.image-manifest.json

The manifest must be emitted by build_owner_open_rootfs_image_release_v2.py and
must still claim ROOTFS_IMAGE_BUILT_NOT_ANDROID_INCLUDED. Soong runs the checked
in verifier, rehashes the full image, and produces the image, manifest and
canonical digest modules. Missing, replaced, writable, duplicated, mismatched or
overclaimed material is a hard build failure. Do not commit generated payload
bytes to this source tree.
